...she usually puts, um...

241
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:48,660
...both her hands on the man's face.

242
00:13:48,820 --> 00:13:51,410
Yeah, I notice that. Is that because she's so passionate?

243
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:54,950
No, it's because that way the camera only sees her.

244
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,750
You want to try it?

245
00:14:01,090 --> 00:14:03,090
Yeah, okay.

246
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:17,890
That was good. That was really good.

247
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:22,980
But I think that maybe your hands are just a little off.

248
00:14:23,150 --> 00:14:25,360
They should be, maybe... Like, right...

249
00:14:23,150 --> 00:14:25,360
Mm.

250
00:14:33,620 --> 00:14:35,790
Well, I feel like a snack.

251
